    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle for Rakir</strong> is an open-world, isometric (top-down) space combat game. This\u00a0RPG is set in orbit around the war-torn desert colony of Rakir.\u00a0Rakir,\u00a0once a slave world, has risen in rebellion against its master, the tyrannical Federation; a galactic power that exploits its colonies for profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a new recruit in Rakir\u2019s amateur spy division, you\u2019ll pilot advanced spacecraft, command small strike fleets, and carry out daring missions to sabotage the Federation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planned gameplay loop is to level up your pilot, customize your build with hundreds of abilities, and make key decisions in a branching campaign that shapes the fate of the rebellion.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a solo indie project. Please help me to make it better, with your suggestions and by reporting any game breaking bugs.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle for Rakir</strong> is an open-world, isometric (top-down) space combat game. This\u00a0RPG is set in orbit around the war-torn desert colony of Rakir.\u00a0Rakir,\u00a0once a slave world, has risen in rebellion against its master, the tyrannical Federation; a galactic power that exploits its colonies for profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a new recruit in Rakir\u2019s amateur spy division, you\u2019ll pilot advanced spacecraft, command small strike fleets, and carry out daring missions to sabotage the Federation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planned gameplay loop is to level up your pilot, customize your build with hundreds of abilities, and make key decisions in a branching campaign that shapes the fate of the rebellion.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a solo indie project. Please help me to make it better, with your suggestions and by reporting any game breaking bugs.</p>",
    "short_description": "Fly, fight, and level up!",
